 ('mashiro','02-tea-break','小さな台所でお茶',False,'''Small cozy Japanese home KITCHEN at morning tea: pale sage curtain, cream tiles, ordinary white enamel kettle and round small kitchen table. Offers a blue-white ceramic cup with sleepy relaxed smile, other hand by saucer. Both braids and beige cardigan. Soft cream/sage/powder-blue morning light, comfortable peer companionship. No antique library or ornate lantern.'''),
 ('mashiro','03-after-rain','雨の駅で待ち合わせ',False,'''Under the roof of a contemporary Japanese RAILWAY PLATFORM on rainy evening. Looks back with small half-lidded smile, holds CLOSED transparent umbrella by curved handle. Both braids, beige cardigan, long sage skirt. Wet platform edge, blurred blue-grey local train, plain roof beams, no readable signs/crowd. Cool navy/powder-blue and one warm-white platform light, not generic amber shopping street.'''),
 ('minto','01-cafe-welcome','ミント色のお出迎え',True,'''Public concept-cafe persona in contemporary MINT-AND-WHITE booth: round mirror, mint geometric panels, soft coral neon accent, clean pastel seating, little white-marble side table. Long straight black hair, green eyes, black/mint costume and decorative bat/horn hair clips. Playful grown-up welcome, connected mouthpiece in hand. Milk-white/mint/lilac/coral, soft bright interior. NO library, ivy, antique lantern or stained glass.'''),
 ('minto','02-instant-photo','チェキ撮影コーナー',False,'''Cafe instant-photo corner with FLAT MINT/PALE-PINK geometric backdrop and small unlettered pennants. Same long straight black hair and black/mint public costume, wink and grown-up cheerful smile, natural V-sign beside face. Unbranded small mint instant camera and blank photo on low white counter. Pastel mint/bubblegum pink/lilac, bright even flash-like light. No words, no border around whole art, no vintage library.'''),
 ('minto','03-private-window','休日の窓辺',False,'''IMPORTANT private ref 3 overrides public outfit: long BLACK hair DOWN, green eyes, white knit cardigan, black blouse, long dark skirt and green-heart accessory; NO bat/horn clips/twin-tails/cafe dress. On low sofa by SIMPLE SQUARE Japanese apartment window, reading one small unlettered paperback and looking up with quiet adult smile. Oatmeal cushion, folded blanket, tiny plant. Misty blue/light grey/soft sage/morning ivory. No elaborate library or European city view.'''),
 ('minto','04-after-hours','閉店後の素顔',False,'''BONUS MIDDLE BETWEEN WORK AND PRIVATE SIDE. Same adult woman still in BLACK/MINT cafe DRESS and mint chest bow/green heart, but WHITE PRIVATE KNIT CARDIGAN over shoulders, long BLACK hair let DOWN, decorative bat/horn clips REMOVED resting naturally on counter or in hand. Both green eyes open, quiet thoughtful grown-up smile, not a performing wink. Closed cafe staff corner: empty plain chairs, closed pale blinds, coat hook, one warm-white task light, decorative neon OFF. Muted mint/grey-lilac/cream. One person, not split-screen or double character. No library/lanterns/street.'''),
 ('ageha','01-professional-taste','ピンクの試香席',True,'''Professional face, both amber eyes OPEN and focused confident small smile. Honey-orange twin ponytails/pink-white BEAR ties, leopard jacket/pink heart top/black skirt. Seated in CONTEMPORARY POP lounge with black modular sofa, HOT-PINK geometric wall planes, terrazzo side table, small chrome mirror. Magenta/peach/black/lilac light, no ivy/library/antique lanterns. One connected mouthpiece after tasting, no hand on hot metal.'''),
 ('ageha','02-grocery-smile','昼の商店街で',False,'''Kind first encounter in DAYTIME Japanese SHOPPING ARCADE: translucent roof, tiled pavement, normal shop shutters and produce stall. Bright filtered sunlight, warm-white/yellow/sky-blue shadows/coral, NOT another sunset lantern street or European old town. Leans toward viewer with cheerful CLOSED smiling eyes, gently offers recovered PAPER grocery bag with supported natural hands. Same bear ponytails/leopard jacket/pink heart. Unlettered groceries, no dialogue or protagonist face.'''),
 ('ageha','03-model-moment','撮影スタジオの一瞬',False,'''Professional model three-quarter pose with both amber eyes OPEN, one hand by hair and other at hip. Same adopted leopard/pink-heart/black outfit and bear ponytail ties. CLEAN real studio: large plain LILAC PAPER backdrop, pink reflector plane, ONE softbox and simple tripod stands. No books, flowers, city window or lounge chair. Lavender/bubblegum-pink with peach key light; pixel art even though photo-shoot setting, not a photo or magazine.'''),
