 ('rin','02-flavor-samples','輸入サンプルを選ぶ',False,'''Practical IMPORTER WORK DESK: grey steel shelves, small corrugated shipping boxes, packing paper, neat unlettered sample tins, black-film window/CLOSED blinds. Tiny open tin contains BLACK glossy sticky finely CHOPPED DARK-LEAF, irregular small shredded/folded pieces, no green whole leaves/blonde flakes/berries. One hand holds tin, other clipboard. Mature focused knowing smile, rolled white blouse/hoops/dark wolf cut. Graphite/cool sage/navy, one warm-white task light. No decorative library/ivy/antiques.'''),
