 ('samechan','01-shishark-test-run','シーシャークの試運転',True,'''Preparing her new shop SHISHARK: pale-blue wall with SIMPLE abstract wave motif, one unopened cardboard box, clean ocean-blue side table and new white/blue booth. Adult adopted black/deep-blue-inner-haired street-sister heroine, BLUE eyes open and playful small toothy smile. Connected mouthpiece in one hand; crowned KORO plush securely on lap supported by other arm. Ocean-blue/cyan/ivory with restrained coral, no text/logo or antique library/ivy/lanterns.'''),
 ('samechan','02-shark-movie','コロちゃんとサメ映画',False,'''Evening HOME MOVIE screening: small contemporary couch, KORO crowned plush on lap, small plain popcorn bowl beside her. BLUE eyes excited, small playful pointed-tooth smile, adopted black/deep-blue inner hair and street-sister hood/costume. Projector beam and BACKGROUND screen with ONE generic shark silhouette in deep water, no existing movie poster/credits, no gore. Ink-blue/projected cyan/muted coral cinema light, flat modern walls, no library or vintage cafe.'''),
 ('samechan','03-aquarium','水族館でコロちゃんと',False,'''BRIGHT AQUARIUM gallery with thick glass tank in BACKGROUND, graceful real shark silhouette swimming behind glass, underwater caustics. Adult heroine outside tank visibly dry, looking back delightedly while hugging crowned KORO plush. Same black/deep-blue INNER hair, blue eyes, black/ivory/pale-blue street-sister hood/outfit and tiny fang smile. Turquoise/pale aqua/cool white, clearly lighter than dark projector scene. No street/movie poster/library or words.'''),
